        "source_quote": "於是士卒爭先，臨陣斬振首。",
        "reading": "懷肅部下斬桓振首。",
        "note": "懷肅部下斬桓振首。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 312,
        "end_codepoint": 325,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence2-325",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "江陵既平，休之反鎮，執懷肅手曰：「微子之力，吾無所歸矣。」",
        "reading": "司馬休之還鎮，感謝懷肅。",
        "note": "司馬休之還鎮，感謝懷肅。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 325,
        "end_codepoint": 354,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence2-354",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "偽輔國將軍符嗣、馬孫、偽龍驤將軍金符青、樂志等屯結江夏，懷肅又討之，梟樂志等。",
        "reading": "討符嗣、馬孫、金符青、樂志等，明言梟樂志等。",
        "note": "討符嗣、馬孫、金符青、樂志等，明言梟樂志等。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 354,
        "end_codepoint": 393,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence2-393",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "道規加懷肅督江夏九郡，權鎮夏口。",
        "reading": "劉道規加懷肅督江夏九郡、權鎮夏口。",
        "note": "劉道規加懷肅督江夏九郡、權鎮夏口。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 393,
        "end_codepoint": 409,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "除通直郎，仍為輔國將軍、淮南歷陽二郡太守。",
        "reading": "除通直郎，仍為輔國將軍、淮南歷陽二郡太守。",
        "note": "除通直郎，仍為輔國將軍、淮南歷陽二郡太守。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 21,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence3-21",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "二年，又領劉毅撫軍司馬，軍、郡如故。",
        "reading": "義熙二年領劉毅撫軍司馬。",
        "note": "義熙二年領劉毅撫軍司馬。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 21,
        "end_codepoint": 39,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence3-39",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "以義功封東興縣侯，食邑千戶。",
        "reading": "封東興縣侯，邑千戶。",
        "note": "封東興縣侯，邑千戶。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 39,
        "end_codepoint": 53,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence3-53",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "其冬，桓石綏、司馬國璠、陳襲於胡桃山聚眾為寇，懷肅率步騎討破之。",
        "reading": "是冬破胡桃山桓石綏、司馬國璠、陳襲。",
        "note": "是冬破胡桃山桓石綏、司馬國璠、陳襲。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 53,
        "end_codepoint": 85,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:received_sentence3-85",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
        "source_quote": "江淮間羣蠻及桓氏餘黨為亂，自請出討，既行失旨，毅上表免懷肅官。",
        "reading": "懷肅出討後失旨，劉毅表免其官。",
        "note": "懷肅出討後失旨，劉毅表免其官。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 85,
        "end_codepoint": 116,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
